  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (130019/A/PL1 Rev P01, 019-PE-99-00-DR-A-0001 Rev P02, 019-PE-00-ZZ-DR-A-0801 Rev P01, 019-PE-BA-00-DR-A-0001 Rev P02, 019-PE-99-00-DR-A-0010 Rev P02, 019-PE-BA-01-DR-A-0101 Rev P02, 019-PE-BA-02-DR-A-0201 Rev P02, 019-PE-BA-08-DR-A-0801 Rev P02, 019-PE-BB-00-DR-A-0001 Rev P02 (received 31/07/2013).\r\n019-PE-BB-01-DR-A-0101 Rev P05, 019-PE-BB-02-DR-A-0201 Rev P05, 019-PE-BB-03-DR-A-0301 Rev P05, 019-PE-BB-08-DR-A-0801 Rev P05 (received 02/09/2013).\r\n019-PE-00-99-DR-A-9910 Rev C02 (received 17/10/2013)) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposal shall be constructed in accordance with the materials samples submitted with the application.",
    "Condition : 4 - The cycle storage shall be provided as specified in the application prior to the occupation of the development.",
    "Condition : 5 - The measures contained in the Travel Plan shall be implemented as approved.",
    "Condition : 6 - The electric car charging point shall be provided as specified in the application prior to the occupation of the buildings.  The electric car charging point shall then be maintained in working order for as long as the development remains in existence.",
    "Condition : 7 - The development shall be carried out and used in accordance with the Delivery and Servicing Plan and Construction Logistics Plan submitted with the application.",
    "Condition : 8 - Within 3 months of work starting on site, a BREEAM Interim (Design Stage) Certificate, issued by the Building Research Establishment (BRE) (or equivalent accredited body), must be submitted to the Local Planning Authority to show that a minimum Very Good rating (aspiring to Excellent) will be achieved.\r\n",
    "Condition : 9 - Prior to first occupation, a BREEAM Final (Post-Construction) Certificate, issued by the BRE (or equivalent accredited body), must be submitted to the Local Planning Authority to demonstrate that a Very Good rating has been achieved. All the measures integrated shall be retained for as long as the development is in existence",
    "Condition : 10 - Prior to the occupation of the development evidence shall be submitted demonstrating that the scheme for achieving a minimum of 25% reduction in carbon emissions has be implemented as approved."
